{"id":"2596351300","kind":"answer","title":"如何帮助孩子爱上学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2022-07-28","updated":"2022-07-28","votes":53,"comment_count":8,"minutes":2,"chars":996,"keywords":["学习动机","学习内驱力","自主学习","强制学习","学校教育"],"summary":"孩子天生热爱学习，别帮倒忙就行了： 学习的乐趣 一如既往，贴一下过去的翻译： 问题 激发孩子学习的最好方法是什么？ 回答 John Holt [1] 曾说过，你「无法从外部激励孩子」。一切好的知识都来自内心。他补充说：「 你可以威胁孩子，也可以贿赂孩子。 [2] 」正如《 学习的乐趣 [3] 》一章所解释的那样，他在很大程度上…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/545092446/answer/2596351300","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"问题"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"回答"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"学习的基本规律"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"-7aUE2ao\">孩子天生热爱学习，别帮倒忙就行了：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1578551193\" href=\"#/post/1578551193\">学习的乐趣</a><p data-pid=\"fFL1A6-W\">一如既往，贴一下过去的翻译：</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">问题</h2><p data-pid=\"Q5s5PPsC\">激发孩子学习的最好方法是什么？</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">回答</h2><p data-pid=\"F54zJI2P\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/John_Holt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">John Holt</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup> 曾说过，你「无法从外部激励孩子」。一切好的知识都来自内心。他补充说：「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coercion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">你可以威胁孩子，也可以贿赂孩子。</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>」正如《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Pleasure_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的乐趣</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>》一章所解释的那样，他在很大程度上是正确的。</p><p data-pid=\"sXj8GQRo\">这并不意味着家长、老师或教育工作者无能为力。在某种程度上，他们可以通过以下工具影响动机：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"skXkfPmW\">改变孩子的环境(例如选择可用的书籍)</li><li data-pid=\"U98kTD5T\">影响知识、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Knowledge_valuation_network\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">估值</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>的对话</li><li data-pid=\"ozRJyDzf\">明智地使用<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Push_zone\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">推动区</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>(例如，鼓励孩子从教育程度较低的游戏转向教育程度较高的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Videogame\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">游戏</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>)</li></ul><p data-pid=\"MMtzG-Uq\">除此之外，一个孩子可以被他的奖励系「操纵」。然而，所有非基于知识的奖励或惩罚都可能因错误的条件反射而适得其反。这可能会导致<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>的最终抑制。特别是，学校的成绩是一种激励因素，会带来<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Dangers_of_being_a_Straight_A_student\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">一系列的负面影响</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"ZWhduUBp\">Alfie Kohn 在 1995 年发现:</p><blockquote data-pid=\"JGI0Sa3l\">由外部诱因引发的动机不仅不如内在动机有效；它可能会<b>侵蚀人的内在动机</b>，即对自己正在做的事情的兴奋感</blockquote><p data-pid=\"sM9RnWM5\">学习动机最好的非具体来源是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Incremental_reading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大量学习本身</a>。这反过来又需要大量的自由和时间。</p><p data-pid=\"SsDTn8ee\"><b>良好的学习产生更多良好的学习。最好的燃料来自内心。</b></p><h2 id=\"sec-3\">学习的基本规律</h2><p data-pid=\"36nSAdPe\">当讨论<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Extrinsic_motivation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">外在动机</a>的危害时，我们必须清楚地区分与学习相关的内在动机（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>）和其他形式的奖励（例如吃的乐趣）。虽然学习应该完全由内在动机驱动，但是外在动机也可以有效地改变人的行为。对乱扔垃圾的处罚可以防止污染环境。如果它们与个人价值体系相结合，它们就形成了一种相对无害的外在动机形式。在学校学习不好的惩罚是普遍有害的。它们违反了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Fundamental_law_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的基本规律</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"SpQCGWo_\"><b>压制<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习内驱力</a></b><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><b>的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Extrinsic_motivation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">外在动机</a>是有害的</b></p><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> John Holt <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"515605862\" href=\"#/post/515605862\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 学习中的强迫 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"351872034\" href=\"#/post/351872034\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 学习的乐趣 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1578551193\" href=\"#/post/1578551193\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 知识评估网络 <a href=\"https://www.kancloud.cn/ankigaokao/supermemo-guru-cn/1895485#610_Knowledge_valuation_network_268\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kancloud.cn/ankigaokao/supermemo-guru-cn/1895485#610_Kno…</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 学习内驱力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 最佳推动区 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"67694020\" href=\"#/post/67694020\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 电子游戏比老师好 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"354952708\" href=\"#/post/354952708\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 做全优学生的危险 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"369391813\" href=\"#/post/369391813\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 学习的基本规律 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"273225977\" href=\"#/post/273225977\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"369391813","title":"成为优等生的危险","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":499,"minutes":32,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"273225977","title":"学习的基本规律","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"67694020","title":"11 最佳推动区","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":61,"minutes":18,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"351872034","title":"学习中的强迫","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":57,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"354952708","title":"电子游戏比老师好","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":25,"minutes":6,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"602150910","title":"学习的乐趣","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":1152,"minutes":88,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"357893386","title":"我怎样才能外在地激励孩子?","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":28,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"620721614","title":"表扬如何毁掉学习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":197,"minutes":22,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"583003405","title":"学习的外在动机","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":55,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"253184005","title":"磨难就是荣耀?","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":91,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"3226806639","title":"如何让孩子爱上学习，自己主动学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":133,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 133 赞同"},{"id":"19319161575","title":"教师如何激发学生主动学习的内驱力？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":93,"minutes":6,"reason":"相似问答 · 93 赞同"},{"id":"2408841927","title":"放眼未来教育趋势，怎么看待“鸡娃”教育？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":18,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 18 赞同"},{"id":"2142914725","title":"通过现金激励孩子是否有效？有没有副作用？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":8,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 8 赞同"},{"id":"2358189876","title":"该不该逼着孩子学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":18,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 18 赞同"}]}